reagent-name-surgicillin = surgicillin
reagent-desc-surgicillin = Treats postoperative infection, reducing severity from 100 to 0 in about two minutes of continuous exposure. Does not remove contamination: clean the wound separately with pure ethanol or irrigate it with pure saline. Does not treat necrosis, dead organs or existing damage.
ent-ChemistryBottleSurgicillin = surgicillin bottle
    .desc = Treats postoperative infection but does not replace wound cleaning or irrigation. Necrosis requires surgery.
    .suffix = Surgicillin
